{"id":845327,"slug":"larry-kro-se-s-rie-1-2000","title":"Larry, kroť se- Série 1","title_en":null,"year":2000,"rating":77,"votes_count":162,"runtime_min":280,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"série","vod_date":"2024-05-21","plot":null,"poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/169/978/169978337_xmw32o.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Robert B. Weide","David Steinberg","Andy Ackerman","Larry Charles","Bryan Gordon"],"actors":["Larry David","Jeff Garlin","Cheryl Hines","Richard Lewis","Kathy Griffin","Sofia Milos","Susie Essman","Tucker Smallwood","Ted Danson","Mary Steenburgen","Tim Bagley","Anne Haney","Buck Kartalian","Louis Mustillo","Bob Odenkirk","Paul Greenberg","Jackie Harris Greenberg","Nan Martin","Brian Palermo","Peter Steinfeld","Robert B. Weide","Rose Abdoo","Karen Maruyama","Oscar Nuñez","Lisa Ann Walter","Nia Vardalos","Diane Keaton","Julia Louis-Dreyfus","Brad Hall","Mike Hagerty","Craig Anton","Paul Dooley","Kaitlin Olson","Kevin Brewerton","Gregg Daniel","Laraine Newman","Allan Arbus","Marissa Jaret Winokur","Cynthia Szigeti","Rose Colasanti","Patrick Kerr","Laura Streicher","Karen-Eileen Gordon","Karen Bankhead","Kevin Ruf","Joe Liss","Wayne Federman"],"screenwriters":["Larry David"],"cinematographers":["Bradley Sellers"],"composers":[],"reviews":[{"author":"Hanys_","text":"Není to žádná řachanda, ale je mi u toho příjemně. Prostě Larry David a jeho talent dostat se pokaždé do nepříjemných situací. Na téhle show je hlavně zajímavé, že je to z hodně velké části improvizace. 7/10(15.03.2024)","stars":3},{"author":"Massaro74","text":"Vysoké hodnocení a spousta sérií, mě přivedlo k nápadu, že to zkouknu. Zatím musím říct, že jsem trochu zklamaný. Není to zrovna to, co jsem čekal, ale dám tomu ještě šanci.. Připadá mi to hrozně uřvané a uhádané, někdy až trapné.. Je znát, že je to improvizace, kolikrát se tomu i sami herci smějí..(21.06.2024)","stars":3},{"author":"metal.storm","text":"Zajímavý počin, pěkné, vtipné, jen to není můj \"šálek čaje\". Každopádně bych doporučila se na seriál podívat. Leckdo ho může zbožňovat.(17.07.2024)","stars":2}],"vods":[{"platform":"HBO Max","url":"https://www.hbomax.com/cz/en/shows/curb-your-enthusiasm/18a0993f-209a-4653-8f94-f3fb8422e678"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/larry-krot-se-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/136236-larry-krot-se/549655-serie-1/prehled/","root_id":136236,"root_title_id":77969,"root_title":"Larry, kroť se","root_slug":"larry-kro-se-2000","is_toplevel":false,"season_no":1,"episode_no":null}